{
  "id": "p12",
  "title": "The Science Fair at the Palace Hotel",
  "titleZh": "宫殿旅馆里的科学展",
  "topic": "校园",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "They go to the science fair in the old town very early today.",
        "zh": "他们今天一早就去了老城区的科学展。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A grand old palace now serves as a busy, friendly hotel.",
        "zh": "一座宏伟的老宫殿如今成了忙碌又友好的旅馆。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My own work starts after a short, quiet walk through the garden.",
        "zh": "我自己的工作在一段安静的小路之后开始，穿过花园就到了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Every pupil carries a notebook and a paper cup to the hall.",
        "zh": "每个学生都带着一个笔记本和一个纸杯走进大厅。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The wide stone floor of the lobby looks clean and bright.",
        "zh": "大堂宽阔的石地板看起来干净又明亮。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The chairman waits inside a small private room near the stairs.",
        "zh": "主席在楼梯旁一间小小的私人房间里等着。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He explains all the rules to us immediately and very clearly.",
        "zh": "他马上把所有的规则给我们讲得清清楚楚。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We expect a special prize for the best and neatest team.",
        "zh": "我们期待着一个特别奖，颁给最好、最整洁的队伍。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then the winner may be named tonight at eight in the big hall.",
        "zh": "然后，今晚八点会在大厅里宣布获胜者。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My dream project shows a model of the brain and its cells.",
        "zh": "我梦想的项目展示了一个大脑模型，还有它的细胞。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Her study looks at cancer cells inside the human body.",
        "zh": "她的研究关注人体内部的癌细胞。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A rapid test marks a real development in modern care.",
        "zh": "一次快速检测标志着现代医疗的一项真正发展。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The operation is hard, but the doctors stay calm and quick.",
        "zh": "手术很难，但医生们保持冷静又迅速。"
      },
      {
        "en": "One small piece sits near the edge of the wooden table.",
        "zh": "一小块东西放在木桌的边缘附近。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A warm meal with fresh meat smells very good and rich.",
        "zh": "一顿有新鲜肉的热饭闻起来非常香。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Green plants cover the land beside the school and the park.",
        "zh": "绿色的植物覆盖着学校旁边和公园旁边的土地。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Most projects look fine, yet two still need a lot of help.",
        "zh": "大多数项目看起来都不错，但有两个仍然需要很多帮助。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later, each turn costs a small coin at the front door.",
        "zh": "后来，每一次轮到都要在正门投一枚小硬币。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Fifteen students bring an article about their test and its result.",
        "zh": "十五个学生带来一篇关于他们测试的文章。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A quick copy helps, but a real reply is always better.",
        "zh": "抄一份很快，但真正的答复总是更好。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Proper credit matters, so please do not miss the name.",
        "zh": "适当的署名很重要，所以请不要漏掉名字。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A stupid spelling mistake can ruin a good page very fast.",
        "zh": "一个愚蠢的拼写错误能很快毁掉好好的一页。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then our class monitor must communicate the result to the judge.",
        "zh": "然后我们班的班长必须把结果告诉评委。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My friend lends me a pen from his coat pocket.",
        "zh": "我的朋友从他的外套口袋里借给我一支笔。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We can sit anywhere and say bye at noon.",
        "zh": "我们可以随便坐在哪里，中午说声再见。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A local solicitor warns the team about corruption and lies.",
        "zh": "一位当地律师提醒队伍注意腐败和谎言。"
      },
      {
        "en": "During the break, other guests share their lunch and talk.",
        "zh": "休息时，别的客人分享他们的午餐，还聊着天。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We should test the main idea in one simple experiment.",
        "zh": "我们应该用一个简单的实验来检验主要的想法。"
      }
    ]
  ],
